WEBVTT

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.840
I love you.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.000
I love you, too.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.720
No, no!

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:32.880
All right.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.800
Didn't I get you already?

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.160
They're very good!

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.080
I'm so proud of you, Son.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.960
You've turned out to be a great
parent!

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.480
Just like me.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.200
Maybe even better.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.040
No, I'm fine. Go ahead.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.120
No, no, no!

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.200
Hey, Carl! Hey.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.320
No, no, no.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.560
Me, me, me.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:41.840
John?

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.320
No, no. Me, me, me.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.080
Oh, poop.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.040
Oh, no!

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.240
Stop! Stop!

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.280
Hello, I am Gru.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.240
Back to work, back to work!
